{"id":"073a1a66749fa84e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-bpp.md","title":"df-bpp (BPP Complexity Class)","display":"df-bpp (BPP Complexity Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-bpp (BPP Complexity Class)","label":"28-df-bpp","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-bpp","BPP","BPP Complexity Class"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_book_location":"Definitions 7.2–7.3; printed pp.125–126; PDF pp.151–152","source_printed_pages":"125–126","source_pdf_pages":"151–152","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bpp (BPP Complexity Class)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-bpp"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-bpp</span><span>BPP</span><span>BPP Complexity Class</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definitions 7.2–7.3; printed pp.125–126; PDF pp.151–152"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"125–126"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"151–152"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>，本条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,r\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\">\\(\\langle x,r\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 在配对输入上的比特输出、停机时间见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上均匀分布。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L\">\\(\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BPP}\">\\(\\mathbf{BPP}\\)</span> 为待定义语言类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M(x;r)\\coloneqq M(\\langle x,r\\rangle),\\qquad \\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\langle x,r\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M(x;r)\\coloneqq M(\\langle x,r\\rangle),\\qquad \\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\langle x,r\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BPP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=\\chi_L(x)]\\ge\\tfrac23\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{BPP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=\\chi_L(x)]\\ge\\tfrac23\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是定义 7.3 的随机带版本，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(n+1)^b\">\\(c(n+1)^b\\)</span> 可通过忽略多余随机位包容任意多项式随机位界。成功概率对每一个输入要求成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]，本条 $\\langle x,r\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 在配对输入上的比特输出、停机时间见 [[28-df-machine-resources]]；$U_j$ 为 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀分布。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,r\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BPP}","display":false},{"tex":"M(x;r)\\coloneqq M(\\langle x,r\\rangle),\\qquad \\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\langle x,r\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BPP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=\\chi_L(x)]\\ge\\tfrac23\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"c(n+1)^b","display":false}],"bytes":1612,"backlinks":[{"id":"99a8573dd28105ee","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{DPRG}$ 见 [[28-df-derandomization-prg]]；$\\mathbf{BPP}$ 与 $\\mathbf P$ 见 [[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-p]]。$\\delta$ 为实数参数，$\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"5f8a5c1b6f317d3c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 是随机带形式的比特输出判定机，$M(x;r)$ 与 $\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)$ 使用 [[28-df-bpp]] 的约定。"},{"id":"efc30a60f20cb4de","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$；$M(x;r)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)$、$U_j$ 使用 [[28-df-bpp]] 的确定型随机带机约定。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"概率机器与类：[[28-df-probabilistic-tm]]、[[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]、[[28-df-zpp]]、[[28-df-pp]]。"},{"id":"c210338b489f6670","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$\\le_r$ 见 [[28-df-randomized-reduction]]；$\\mathbf{BPP}$ 见 [[28-df-bpp]]。"},{"id":"c8ba441dc36f60de","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}$；$\\chi_L$ 为其特征函数，见 [[28-df-bpp]]。"},{"id":"1165db05a0a23506","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}$，$M,a,b,c$ 是 [[28-df-bpp]] 的见证，$q(n)=c(n+1)^b$；$\\chi_L$ 为语言特征函数。"},{"id":"1392e4ae6d9e4b1c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathbf{BPP}$ 见 [[28-df-bpp]]；$\\overline A=\\Sigma^*\\setminus A$。"},{"id":"08022e9739f16906","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}$，见 [[28-df-bpp]]；$M$ 是经 [[28-thm-bpp-amplification]] 放大的确定型随机带机器，$n=|x|$，使用 $m(n)$ 个随机位。"},{"id":"e5499663d4761f00","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BPP},\\mathbf{EXP},\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{time}_M,M(x)$ 分别见 [[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-exp]]、[[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。$\\chi_L$ 见 [[28-df-characteristic-language]]，$\\langle b\\rangle$ 是比特 $b$ 的单字符字串；$\\log_2$ 为二底对数。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","b5d4fc2d291ce98b","0dfeff4bd5d69b86"]}